{%- from "place.njk" import placeStyle %}
  <!-- ==============================================================
       A. WHAT HE TALKS ABOUT - the candle wheel. A pinned stage over
       velvet. First one candle rises from below the screen, tall, then
       settles and lights in its spot on the wheel while its neighbours
       come up either side. The wheel stands on its edge below the
       screen, a full ring
       of nine candle places 40 degrees apart (one candle per line, the
       rest unlit fillers), so there is always a candle each side of the
       top one. The top candle is lit and its line stands above its
       flame; each 80svh of scroll turns the wheel one step. Then the
       ending: "Three talks." comes up large behind the resting candle;
       the top candle and its two neighbours rise out of the ring into a
       row of three upright, lit candles (the rest fade), while "Three
       talks." rolls up and out of an invisible window and "for people,
       teams and organizations." rolls up into it, in front; then the
       camera pushes into the gap between the left and the middle
       candle while the velvet fades and the talks section shows in the
       gap; the candles stay in front, then scroll away (two visual lines, aria-hidden; the real heading is in the talks
       section). Hovering a lit candle's flame brightens its glow. The
       track is 780svh:
         0-60     the intro: the first candle rises, then settles
         60-540   six beats, one line each (the sixth is the bridge)
         540-620  the sixth candle lit, the bridge holds
         620-720  the ending: line A, the three rise, line B
         700-780  the push, on through the hold (720-780) while the
                  talks section rises under the stage
       Phones: no hold beat and a long grow instead of the row: the
       ending starts 16svh after the bridge is fully in (432): "Three
       talks." comes up behind the one candle and crossfades into B, low
       and in front; the candle grows x1 -> x2 and rises over
       data-grow-phone svh (480) and dissolves into the velvet over its
       last 50svh; then the stage scrolls away with the talks reel right
       under it: 1072svh.
       The six lines are real text in reading order at all times; the
       wheel is a decorative canvas. Reduced motion, Save-Data and no
       script: no pin, the six lines stacked (with script, each under a
       lit candle) on the velvet.
       ============================================================== -->
  {%- set intro = block | motion('intro', 60) %}{% set beat = block | motion('beat', 80) %}{% set grow = block | motion('grow', 100) %}{% set growPhone = block | motion('growPhone', 480) %}
  <section class="spk-said"{% if block.id and block.anchor !== false %} id="{{ block.id }}"{% endif %} aria-labelledby="{{ block.id }}-h" data-tone="{{ block | tone('plum-2') }}" data-intro="{{ intro }}" data-beat="{{ beat }}" data-grow="{{ grow }}" data-grow-phone="{{ growPhone }}" style="--intro:{{ intro }};--beats:{{ block.lines.length }};--beat:{{ beat }};--grow:{{ grow }};--grow-phone:{{ growPhone }}">
    <div class="spk-said__track">
      <div class="spk-said__stage">
        <img class="spk-said__velvet" src="{{ block.velvet.src | root(r) }}" {%- set ss1 = block.velvet.src | srcset(r) %}{% if ss1 %} srcset="{{ ss1 }}"{% endif %} sizes="{{ block.velvet.sizes or '100vw' }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <div class="spk-said__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        {%- set pw = placeStyle(block.windowPlacement) | trim %}
        {% if pw | length %}<div class="place place--win-a" style="{{ pw }}"><div class="place__inner">{% endif %}<div class="spk-said__win spk-said__win--a" aria-hidden="true"><p class="spk-said__nextA">{{ block.windowA | inline('spk-said__cur') }}</p></div>{% if pw | length %}</div></div>{% endif %}
        <canvas class="spk-said__wheel" aria-hidden="true" data-frames="{{ 'assets/img/' | root(r) }}"></canvas>
        {% if pw | length %}<div class="place place--win-b" style="{{ pw }}"><div class="place__inner">{% endif %}<div class="spk-said__win spk-said__win--b" aria-hidden="true"><p class="spk-said__nextB">{{ block.windowB | inline('spk-said__cur') }}</p></div>{% if pw | length %}</div></div>{% endif %}
        <div class="spk-said__inner">
          {%- set ph = placeStyle(block.headingPlacement) | trim %}
          {% if ph | length %}<div class="place place--h" style="{{ ph }}"><div class="place__inner">{% endif %}<h2 class="spk-said__h fill" id="{{ block.id }}-h"{{ block.heading | fillAttrs }}>{{ block.heading | fillWords }}</h2>{% if ph | length %}</div></div>{% endif %}
          {%- set pl = placeStyle(block.linesPlacement) | trim %}
          {% if pl | length %}<div class="place place--lines" style="{{ pl }}"><div class="place__inner">{% endif %}
          <div class="spk-said__lines">
          {%- for line in block.lines %}
            <p class="spk-said__line{% if loop.last %} spk-said__bridge{% endif %}" data-beat="{{ loop.index }}"><span class="spk-said__no">{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span>{{ line | inline() }}</p>
          {%- endfor %}
          </div>
          {% if pl | length %}</div></div>{% endif %}
          <p class="spk-sr" id="{{ block.id }}-live" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
